[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0010","text":"啊～\n好像有甜甜的味道～♡"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0020","text":"真的呢……\n好像有什么好香的味道……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0030","text":"这个味道是……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0040","text":"……鲷鱼烧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0050","text":"这里啊，我记得……\n以前不是另一家店吗～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0060","text":"啊……\n也许吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0070","text":"这样啊～\n那感觉有点寂寞呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0080","text":"嗯、嗯……\n不过，以前那家店毕业了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0090","text":"然后新开了鲷鱼烧店，大概是这样的吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0093","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0094","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0095","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100200_04_0100","text":"……要吃的话我去排队"}]
